1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:05,620
Dante: Fun fact. In every zombie movie,
somebody on the bus is hiding a bite.

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:10,823
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part one of ten: the last departure.

3
00:00:11,143 --> 00:00:15,492
Rosa: Doors close in ten seconds. Anyone
not on, stays in this city.

4
00:00:15,812 --> 00:00:18,381
Steve: Waaait. I have a ticket.

5
00:00:18,501 --> 00:00:19,749
Rosa: Nobody gets on.

6
00:00:20,069 --> 00:00:20,614
Teddy: Bye, Steve!

7
00:00:20,734 --> 00:00:23,071
Priya: Teddy. You can't name the zombie.

8
00:00:23,191 --> 00:00:24,091
Teddy: He looks like a Steve.

9
00:00:24,411 --> 00:00:25,445
Rosa: Three rules.

10
00:00:25,565 --> 00:00:26,813
Rosa: Nobody gets on.

11
00:00:26,933 --> 00:00:27,986
Rosa: Nobody gets off.

12
00:00:28,106 --> 00:00:29,579
Rosa: And don't talk to the driver.

13
00:00:29,899 --> 00:00:33,029
Priya: Listen. A bite turns you in about
ten hours.

14
00:00:33,349 --> 00:00:34,373
Priya: First, a fever.

15
00:00:34,493 --> 00:00:35,655
Priya: Then sweating.

16
00:00:35,775 --> 00:00:36,622
Priya: Shaking.

17
00:00:36,742 --> 00:00:37,579
Priya: Confusion.

18
00:00:37,699 --> 00:00:38,709
Priya: And red eyes.

19
00:00:39,029 --> 00:00:42,268
Priya: If anyone's been bitten, tell us
now. We can help.

20
00:00:44,688 --> 00:00:47,568
Marcus: Not bitten! Scared. Different
thing.

21
00:00:47,888 --> 00:00:51,711
June: I've outlived two husbands, dear.
Nobody's biting me.

22
00:00:52,031 --> 00:00:54,446
Vic: Chat, nobody's bitten. Drop a one if
you agree.

23
00:00:54,766 --> 00:00:55,133
Lena: Nope.

24
00:00:56,666 --> 00:00:59,570
Benny: Cluck... I mean, no. Sorry.

25
00:00:59,890 --> 00:01:01,115
Mr. Park: I have a nine o'clock meeting.

26
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:05,014
Dante: Obviously not. I'd know. I've seen
the movies.

27
00:01:05,334 --> 00:01:07,701
Rosa: Nobody's bitten. Sit down.

28
00:01:08,021 --> 00:01:12,472
BUS-E: Ten hours to Pier 8. Please keep
arms, legs and brains inside the vehicle.

29
00:01:12,792 --> 00:01:20,292
BUS-E: Part one of ten, The Last Bus. Next stop: the
tunnel. Follow for part two, and please be very, very quiet.

